    <briefdescription>
<para>This class converts the costmap_2d into a set of non-convex polygons (and points) </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>All single points that do not define a cluster (noise) are also treated as polygon (represented as a single vertex) <xrefsect id="todo_1_todo000004"><xreftitle>Todo</xreftitle><xrefdescription><para>change the class hierarchy to a clearer and more generic one </para>
</xrefdescription></xrefsect></para>
